Personally, I'm not a fan of inline ifs, so if we stay with using `if` statements it should be changed to
```ts
if (message.type) {
  data += `event: ${message.type}\n`;
}
```
And this is what most of Nest's codebase does already even for single line. So ternary, or using braces as necessary should be fine. Just to stay consistent with the rest of the codebase

